{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11106150","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11106150","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110615001:1":{"text":"これほどの強敵を打ち破るなんて――","source_cn":"能击败如此强敌——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x643222A9BE9B3FC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110615002:0":{"text":"まさか本当に、この二人が戦歌祭の覇者となるのでしょうか！皆さん、熱烈な拍手で彼らを讃えましょう！","source_cn":"难道他们真的有机会摘取战歌节的桂冠？让我们以热烈的掌声...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33D6DA3BD10C99A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110615003:1":{"text":"素晴らしい！我がライバルとして申し分ない！いい戦いだったぞ！","source_cn":"好！你们称得上是我沙奎尔的强敌！我喜欢这样的战斗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37D1987F51E9BBAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110615004:1":{"text":"戦意が滾ってきたっ！さすがはお前が認めたババリアだ。俺もまだまだ鍛錬が必要だな……","source_cn":"我的战意又燃起来了，不愧是你认可的蛮血。磨练再度召唤了我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DBBFE734D109945","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110615005:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、次こそは俺と戦ってもらうぞ！","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2B9D903CBB21FA4A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、次こそは俺と戦ってもらうぞ！","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、次こそは俺と戦ってもらうぞ！","variant_male_record_index":"122067","variant_female_record_index":"122068","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1110615005":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、次こそは俺と戦ってもらうぞ！","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，下一次，我们再交手！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2B9D903CBB21FA4A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、次こそは俺と戦ってもらうぞ！","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、次こそは俺と戦ってもらうぞ！","variant_male_record_index":"122067","variant_female_record_index":"122068","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110615006:0":{"text":"その時は、決して負けん。","source_cn":"到时，我绝不会输。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8022D8B8B677E952","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110615008:1":{"text":"皆さーん！ついにこの時がやってまいりました！","source_cn":"曼卡拉的老朋友们！残阳武斗场最激动人心的表演赛——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEF34F7725F7F1C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110615009:1":{"text":"前回の優勝者ブルータス対準優勝者オルグのエキシビションマッチです！","source_cn":"上一届的冠亚军！布鲁特斯对阵奥格，即将开场！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F3FE9346F9F1552","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110615010